        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇系统综述与荟萃分析，旨在综合现有证据以评估FMT作为增强ICI疗效辅助策略的临床价值。研究通过系统检索PubMed及临床试验注册库，筛选出10项涉及164名患者的研究进行定量合成。主要发现显示，FMT联合ICI的总体客观缓解率（ORR）为43%，其中抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4双药治疗的ORR显著高于单药治疗（60% vs 37%）。安全性方面，1-2级不良事件发生率为42%，3-4级为37%。尽管结果呈现初步积极信号，但作者指出由于纳入研究多为早期小样本试验且缺乏长期随访数据，结论尚需大规模RCT进一步验证。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::153738efad1ff78582447def2bcb3c312f0a586a7520f897f63871d450a16bd8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed0122eebbbfbabb244e6146a032e01b105144b0d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::467b3735ad16916cc769c7f78077211279931ea6fc9e827d285d72e065a4d00f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::146402c1e4e21f9c0177adc0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::146402c1e4e21f9c0177adc0",
      "source_handle": "P0212",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述“肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤中ICI疗效”提供了关键的临床关联证据。它证实了通过FMT重塑微生物群确实能提升ICI的客观缓解率，特别是在双药联合背景下。同时，它指出了当前临床转化的瓶颈：异质性高、缺乏标准化协议、以及机制不明。对于机制部分，它提供了理论假设框架（如增加有益菌、调节TME），但未提供直接的分子机制验证。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::153738efad1ff78582447def2bcb3c312f0a586a7520f897f63871d450a16bd8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed0122eebbbfbabb244e6146a032e01b105144b0d8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3508aed93981ff34ea8b794360ddc4625061d64b0ab3ab1054073bc4e899ce6c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3b7b7af558c58a4499ecb4c3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3b7b7af558c58a4499ecb4c3",
      "source_handle": "P0212",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅反映临床终点（ORR/PFS/OS），未直接测量微生物群的具体组成变化与疗效之间的因果链条。异质性较高，不能代表所有患者群体。",
        "contribution": "提供了FMT联合ICI在实体瘤中的汇总临床疗效数据（ORR 43%），证实了微生物干预对ICI疗效的正向调节作用。特别指出抗PD-1/CTLA-4双药联合时疗效显著提升（ORR 60%），提示微生物群可能增强双重阻断的协同效应。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::153738efad1ff78582447def2bcb3c312f0a586a7520f897f63871d450a16bd8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed0122eebbbfbabb244e6146a032e01b105144b0d8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::75433da9e41d3b1e6bbd3b9c86890511fc401ff5b2887d55cc7ab9c939ab996d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::67be511ff34ca792f3f21ce8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::67be511ff34ca792f3f21ce8",
      "source_handle": "P0212",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物群是否以及如何调节ICI疗效”的问题，提供临床层面的有效性证据。可用于支持“微生物群是ICI疗效的关键决定因素”这一论点，并展示不同治疗策略下的疗效差异。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::153738efad1ff78582447def2bcb3c312f0a586a7520f897f63871d450a16bd8",
          "field_path": [
