    "atom::740021f66edd4876cdcd806a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::740021f66edd4876cdcd806a",
      "source_handle": "P0590",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "旨在澄清肠道微生物组在结直肠癌中从“旁观者”到“主动驱动者”的角色转变，评估当前基于微生物组的诊断 biomarkers 和治疗手段的临床证据水平、主要障碍及未来转化方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b99a07f7e776a0db3b5e6d39a414202d36fdad833",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b781f95b55a09db65ae191fd6c487540c35bfd6c371",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3c41d47ca687cbeff5096d44b22185948ffc30abf73e2fbcfc53daecbb189405",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3c5d20c7ff13df6e2d4bc544": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3c5d20c7ff13df6e2d4bc544",
      "source_handle": "P0590",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "结直肠癌（CRC）与肠道微生物组的关系，涵盖致癌机制、保护性菌群功能、基于微生物组的生物标志物开发及临床治疗策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b99a07f7e776a0db3b5e6d39a414202d36fdad833",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b781f95b55a09db65ae191fd6c487540c35bfd6c371",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9d61cd318738f8a635e650eb6fcc6d95743574e1686f337f26e79b0bc8465b19",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3c49fb77560c87b3639984ff": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3c49fb77560c87b3639984ff",
      "source_handle": "P0590",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道微生物组在结直肠癌发生发展中的主动驱动作用及其临床转化潜力。文章首先详细阐述了多种病原体（如具核梭杆菌、pks+大肠杆菌等）通过炎症、代谢紊乱、基因毒性和免疫逃逸促进肿瘤发生的分子机制，并介绍了有益菌群及其代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸）的保护作用。随后，文章评估了基于粪便宏基因组学的生物标志物研究进展，指出其在早期检测中的高准确性但面临标准化和混杂因素控制的挑战。最后，综述了饮食调节、益生菌、粪菌移植（FMT）及工程菌等治疗策略的证据等级，强调目前多数疗法仍处于实验或早期临床阶段，且抗生素使用可能增加风险。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b99a07f7e776a0db3b5e6d39a414202d36fdad833",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b781f95b55a09db65ae191fd6c487540c35bfd6c371",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c62eab8255815a8b1cd2c6184e0439f1cc518819ca75b12a76908c6adee87759",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2b0fafde461996375e2abb36": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2b0fafde461996375e2abb36",
      "source_handle": "P0590",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何影响实体瘤（特别是结直肠癌）免疫治疗响应提供了关键的背景机制和现状评估。它详细列出了可能增强或削弱免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的微生物特征（如Fn富集导致耐药，特定益生菌增强疗效），并指出了FMT联合ICI治疗的潜在前景及当前证据局限。这对于回答微生物组调节ICI疗效的机制和现状至关重要。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b99a07f7e776a0db3b5e6d39a414202d36fdad833",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b781f95b55a09db65ae191fd6c487540c35bfd6c371",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2b270109c20d621b3475c3e5a7811e4d8b85234e220adac7227512ba638ce90a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fd0eb3a18c55d9853ec4173a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fd0eb3a18c55d9853ec4173a",
      "source_handle": "P0590",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "主要证据来自结直肠癌的体外/体内模型或小规模观察性研究；FMT在CRC中的有效性尚未在随机对照试验中证实；不同肿瘤类型（如黑色素瘤 vs CRC）的微生物效应可能存在差异，不可直接外推。",
        "contribution": "提供了微生物组调节免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的具体实例和证据等级。明确指出Fn和Pa与抗PD-1治疗抵抗相关，而某些益生菌（如Bifidobacterium）在动物模型中增强ICI疗效。FMT在黑色素瘤中恢复ICI响应的临床证据被引用，但在CRC中仅为探索性试验。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b99a07f7e776a0db3b5e6d39a414202d36fdad833",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b781f95b55a09db65ae191fd6c487540c35bfd6c371",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::220c55d2b6a35c153f923daef86dfbea08cb5ae3673e72a5c5ca0407d57b5f79",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7adc93eba19af6322285626f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7adc93eba19af6322285626f",
      "source_handle": "P0590",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于支持‘微生物组成分影响ICI疗效’这一观点，列举具体正负向影响的菌种，并说明当前临床转化的阶段（实验性）。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b99a07f7e776a0db3b5e6d39a414202d36fdad833",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b781f95b55a09db65ae191fd6c487540c35bfd6c371",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bc0567a88916a07088a13ec83dad2e2ad74b77b74a158b76602d3358ae15b915",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::be7b29635f6a16bdd8933ea3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::be7b29635f6a16bdd8933ea3",
      "source_handle": "P0590",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制描述多为细胞或动物模型层面的因果推断；人类体内确切的因果链条仍需更多验证；不同菌株亚型（如Fn的不同clades）可能有不同效应。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物影响免疫微环境的分子机制。包括：1) Fn通过Fap2结合TIGIT抑制T/NK细胞毒性；2) Pa通过TLR2/4激活MDSC抑制CD8+/CD4+ T细胞；3) ETBF诱导Th17/IL-17炎症反应；4) 有益菌代谢物（SCFAs）调节树突状细胞/T细胞反应。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
