      "value": "Provides mechanistic depth for how adjuvants reverse ICI resistance, offering specific pathways (e.g., STAT3/galectin-3, Dectin-1/Syk/NF-kB) to cite when discussing non-microbiota mechanisms.",
      "role": "planning",
