    },
    "atom::5385a7857d92f184b107095e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5385a7857d92f184b107095e",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "遵循PRISMA指南进行系统综述。使用Covidence管理流程，检索特定关键词组合。纳入标准为成人实体瘤患者，排除非英语、非人类、评论类文章。数据提取包括患者数量、ICI类型、癌症类型、干预措施及其对微生物多样性、OS、PFS和irAE的影响。未进行荟萃分析（因已有相关Meta分析且异质性高），而是采用定性综合方法，对比抗生素组与非抗生素组、FMT干预前后的临床结局和免疫学指标。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::86a8c1a33d79f1a1e0c999b4e8d2565fefb28377d065faed8b52c3cc71e10179",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8a995b8b38ea63be01d384b5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8a995b8b38ea63be01d384b5",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了截至2021年的系统性证据汇总，确认抗生素使用与ICI疗效降低的强关联，以及FMT在逆转耐药和管理irAE方面的潜在益处。",
        "limits": "1. 未进行定量Meta分析，限制了效应量的精确估计。2. 纳入研究多为观察性或小样本临床试验，存在选择偏倚和混杂因素（如合并用药、饮食、种族信息缺失）。3. OS和PFS定义不统一，影响结果可比性。4. FMT研究样本量极小，且部分患者在使用FMT前接受了强效免疫抑制剂，干扰因果推断。5. 缺乏关于抗生素种类、剂量及具体微生物群落变化的详细数据。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a378a2d5b5cb8418c7c4ba47d66fa24d8659a17e148e3c56aecabe5908445b51",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f61397f7ac6f10ccd811c334": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f61397f7ac6f10ccd811c334",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "抗生素使用（主要覆盖NSCLC, RCC, Melanoma，靶向PD-1/PD-L1为主），时间窗多为ICI开始前2个月至开始后1个月内",
        "finding": "21/22项研究显示抗生素对OS和/或PFS有显著的负面影响。例如，Schett et al. (2019)中NSCLC患者抗生素组OS为1.8 vs 15.4个月；Pinato et al. (2019)中pATB组OS为2 vs 26个月。部分研究（如Lalani et al., Balado et al.）未发现显著差异，但总体趋势为负面。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::64f332d4080bb9e7988e7a7c1c6c313b8679b0b456d92866febf55846c0bc443",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::62930893a334abdd4a90dacc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::62930893a334abdd4a90dacc",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "FMT用于ICI耐药或发生严重irAE的实体瘤患者（主要为黑色素瘤，少量前列腺癌/尿路上皮癌）",
        "finding": "所有6项FMT研究显示积极效果。Davar et al. (2019)中40%耐药患者克服耐药；Youngster et al. 和 Baruch et al. 分别报告60%和30%的患者克服耐药，伴随CD8+ T细胞浸润增加和IL-8下调。Wang et al. (2018, 2020)显示FMT可缓解ICI诱导的结肠炎（73%临床响应）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::64f332d4080bb9e7988e7a7c1c6c313b8679b0b456d92866febf55846c0bc443",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
