        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "1. 肠道微生物群改变药物（主要是抗生素）是否会对ICI的疗效产生不利影响？2. FMT是否能通过恢复肠道微生物群来改善ICI疗效并降低irAE的发生率？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7081131e522f91291050b03477a29bd80d5686135828127b7e770f0cd4ccc376",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ec580adacab9bbedb26ba339": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ec580adacab9bbedb26ba339",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "针对晚期实体瘤患者，考察肠道微生物群改变药物（主要为抗生素及其他伴随用药）和粪便微生物群移植（FMT）对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效（总生存期OS、无进展生存期PFS）及毒性（免疫相关不良事件irAEs）的影响。纳入2015年1月至2021年4月发表的英文研究。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3d1b8ef0059ad4bbcac8a76645a1287135b40992efb57211d121e03d7f99d1a2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e6de935b19653fcb6e426043": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e6de935b19653fcb6e426043",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇系统综述，旨在评估肠道菌群调节干预措施与ICI治疗结果之间的关联。作者检索了OVID Medline、Embase等数据库，筛选出28项符合标准的研究：其中22项关注抗生素/其他药物对ICI疗效的影响，6项关注FMT对ICI疗效及irAE减轻的作用。结果显示，绝大多数（21/22）涉及抗生素的研究表明其显著降低OS和/或PFS；所有6项涉及FMT的研究均显示其在恢复ICI疗效或减少irAE方面具有积极效果。综述同时指出了现有研究在定义终点、样本量、混杂因素控制等方面的局限性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::067ccb739f696e139b4ab82d6dbbfbee39ed19e569ff0e0948f343197a6ee1c5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b13a35c6897193bfcfe66518": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b13a35c6897193bfcfe66518",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为“肠道菌群如何调节ICI疗效”这一核心问题提供了关键的临床相关性证据和机制线索。它确立了抗生素作为负面调节因子、FMT作为潜在正向调节因子的临床地位，并提供了具体的免疫学机制假设（如CD8+ T细胞激活、IL-8抑制）。对于综述而言，它是连接宏观临床结局（OS/PFS）与微观免疫机制的重要桥梁，特别是提供了FMT干预后的具体免疫表型变化数据，有助于解释“为什么”某些菌群结构有利于ICI反应。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a3912e43ab77233a36e0451aa1a97be270b445d7fa65d3dbbed801a541ea9671",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::91e994144d313746f98c75e2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::91e994144d313746f98c75e2",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅基于回顾性队列和小样本前瞻性研究，无法确立严格的因果关系；不同癌症类型和ICI亚型的效果可能存在差异（尽管多数为PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂）。",
        "contribution": "提供了抗生素使用导致ICI疗效下降的大规模临床观察证据（21/22研究支持），以及FMT改善疗效的具体案例数据。明确了肠道菌群状态是ICI疗效的重要预测/影响因素。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2b6982aeaf33e03ef423e85027d18ce2cda2a8b52bb43bfdc4e666644ae5beca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0654bf9657531171814387bd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0654bf9657531171814387bd",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于论证肠道菌群完整性对ICI有效性的必要性；作为抗生素应避免随意使用的临床依据；作为FMT潜在治疗价值的背景支持。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e56bc749d37842a9c795047678679e841bb8fa478d2e967334391735def4a1f6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3f83ec56f5f6859978c91322": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3f83ec56f5f6859978c91322",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制描述主要来自少数几个高质量的小样本研究（如Davar, Youngster, Baruch），其他研究多仅报告临床结局；部分机制（如IL-8下调）尚未在所有FMT研究中得到一致验证；需区分是直接由菌群引起还是继发于免疫状态改变。",
        "contribution": "揭示了FMT起效的部分潜在免疫机制：增加CD8+ T细胞浸润、增加抗原呈递细胞（CD68+）、下调促耐药因子IL-8及其产生的髓系细胞。这些发现直接指向了T细胞介导的抗肿瘤免疫增强和炎症微环境改善。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2b6982aeaf33e03ef423e85027d18ce2cda2a8b52bb43bfdc4e666644ae5beca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e626fc3aa7256b5fff4058fb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e626fc3aa7256b5fff4058fb",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释FMT如何通过重塑免疫微环境来恢复ICI敏感性；提供具体的生物标志物（如IL-8, CD8+ T cells）作为机制研究的切入点；说明菌群-免疫轴的具体作用路径。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e56bc749d37842a9c795047678679e841bb8fa478d2e967334391735def4a1f6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::721f781a7291a3c4ccd59163": {
      "atom_id": "atom::721f781a7291a3c4ccd59163",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "综述指出大多数纳入研究集中在NSCLC, RCC, Melanoma，且主要使用抗PD-1/PD-L1药物。同时提到化疗等其他抗癌治疗也可能破坏肠道屏障和菌群。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5ade4cc6f60943b91edff50f2019e0015abf778c0d76aabc249af8604a5b31e1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9154120f7ba7b8b59563c318": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9154120f7ba7b8b59563c318",
      "source_handle": "P0304",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "帮助综述明确当前证据主要集中在哪些肿瘤类型和药物类别，提示未来需要扩展到其他ICI（如CTLA-4）和其他癌症类型；提醒注意化疗等混杂因素对菌群的影响。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::235e35281eb4c1f2e906be101098a861f880c661131e23e0f6ff09d6bbcc5d03",
