      "source_handle": "P0358",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "Provides mechanistic hypotheses to explain how the microbiome modulates ICPI efficacy and toxicity. Useful for discussing the biological plausibility of microbiome-immunotherapy interactions. Illustrates the link between local gut immunity and systemic toxicity.",
