    "atom::4d9086cad83959bd751a5143": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4d9086cad83959bd751a5143",
      "source_handle": "P0006",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "在mRCC患者中，添加CBM588到一线ICI联合治疗方案中，如何影响肠道微生物组的组成和菌群失调状态？其是否通过调节微生物组来介导临床获益？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ae6fc092083bad76a3be286e49684b5c3f415ec697f0b3a6f27ad3969d1723b6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::92e15a48ae2f2bde17089520fd30936b04b14a718b945e2d16eb30c9cfa45845",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a35910d01fdeeda24d7f32b7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a35910d01fdeeda24d7f32b7",
      "source_handle": "P0006",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "转移性肾细胞癌（mRCC）患者，接受一线免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）联合治疗（纳武利尤单抗/伊匹木单抗或卡博替尼/纳武利尤单抗），部分患者联合使用活体生物疗法CBM588。样本来自两项I期临床试验的合并队列，共58名患者。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ae6fc092083bad76a3be286e49684b5c3f415ec697f0b3a6f27ad3969d1723b6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::86071509136bcbd2de5a1e6364770ba723151b695bb92c406c9a9f5527426166",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::258b37d2499172ba1cff0c79": {
      "atom_id": "atom::258b37d2499172ba1cff0c79",
      "source_handle": "P0006",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探讨活体生物疗法CBM588对接受一线ICI联合治疗的mRCC患者肠道微生物组组成及菌群失调的影响。研究团队合并了两项I期随机临床试验的数据，对比了标准治疗（SOC）组与SOC联合CBM588组在基线和第12周时的肠道微生物多样性及组成变化。结果显示，CBM588显著改善了菌群失调指标，并防止了与ICI疗效相关的特定菌种耗竭，为CBM588增强临床疗效提供了潜在的微生物机制解释。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ae6fc092083bad76a3be286e49684b5c3f415ec697f0b3a6f27ad3969d1723b6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c512566579272006a142e2e0d18cbbd68b33e6033358835ec70d0edfb3ebbf45",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::554e9d081b73a6c2e92e9171": {
      "atom_id": "atom::554e9d081b73a6c2e92e9171",
      "source_handle": "P0006",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了CBM588作为微生物组调节剂在mRCC ICI治疗中的具体作用证据。它展示了特定的微生物响应模式（纠正F/B比率、保护E. siraeum），可用于综述中关于“微生物组特征预测或介导ICI疗效”以及“益生菌/合生元干预策略”的部分。特别适用于讨论哪些微生物变化与ICI治疗期间的菌群失调缓解相关。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ae6fc092083bad76a3be286e49684b5c3f415ec697f0b3a6f27ad3969d1723b6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6edcf4396483ef0e04c8c5c773232fa5e3cc5a4a2034e2c9c7c7092ea72c7086",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b5e043583ccc1fe222739c3e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b5e043583ccc1fe222739c3e",
      "source_handle": "P0006",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限mRCC人群；仅涉及CBM588这一种干预手段；未提供临床终点与微生物变化的直接相关性统计，仅作为机制推测的基础。",
        "contribution": "提供了CBM588干预下mRCC患者肠道微生物组的具体变化图谱。显示CBM588能逆转ICI治疗常见的菌群失调趋势（降低F/B比率），并维持Eubacterium siraeum水平。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ae6fc092083bad76a3be286e49684b5c3f415ec697f0b3a6f27ad3969d1723b6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d831ebca47ad0b40e1a7955072f9476b8e91fee8a667a6ef37fc6b8ed9a35f5a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d011efed14e3bd22d00514dc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d011efed14e3bd22d00514dc",
      "source_handle": "P0006",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物组如何调节ICI疗效”中的描述性问题，即展示一种成功的微生物组干预案例及其对应的微生物学改变。可作为支持“特定微生物群有助于维持ICI疗效”的证据之一。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ae6fc092083bad76a3be286e49684b5c3f415ec697f0b3a6f27ad3969d1723b6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a4dd2a91b51b82d98aa40a1a9cd9326aa620be8364270b1cbcc15b5e77be8399",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3e2e9022343dde30c2c59134": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3e2e9022343dde30c2c59134",
      "source_handle": "P0006",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这是基于观察到的微生物变化的“合理机制推测”，而非经过功能验证的因果证据。需结合其他研究确认E. siraeum在ICI疗效中的具体功能角色。",
        "contribution": "提出了CBM588通过防止有益菌（E. siraeum）耗竭和纠正菌群失调来介导临床获益的潜在机制路径。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ae6fc092083bad76a3be286e49684b5c3f415ec697f0b3a6f27ad3969d1723b6",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d831ebca47ad0b40e1a7955072f9476b8e91fee8a667a6ef37fc6b8ed9a35f5a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0188dd6b368b7524f2fe4053": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0188dd6b368b7524f2fe4053",
      "source_handle": "P0006",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中关于“机制”的部分，说明微生物组成分的改变（特别是特定菌种的保留和群落结构的稳定）可能是ICI疗效增强的中介因素。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ae6fc092083bad76a3be286e49684b5c3f415ec697f0b3a6f27ad3969d1723b6",
