    "atom::0cc71cf5ee6821ea9fb384e8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0cc71cf5ee6821ea9fb384e8",
      "source_handle": "P0143",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "在mRCC患者中，补充CBM588如何影响肠道微生物组的组成和菌群失调状态？其是否通过调节微生物组来增强ICI治疗的潜在疗效？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::890fce072a8f724aaec9108f7e6fb477e88b3e6ebacc50fe6157574d9cf1fe81",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b2b191561da680c1cc729004340465539c838f935cc733588727975e46da6702",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a95d397296501b878a36122b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a95d397296501b878a36122b",
      "source_handle": "P0143",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "转移性肾细胞癌（mRCC）患者，接受一线免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）联合治疗（纳武利尤单抗/伊匹木单抗或卡博替尼/纳武利尤单抗），并补充活体生物制剂CBM588。研究基于两项I期临床试验的合并队列。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::890fce072a8f724aaec9108f7e6fb477e88b3e6ebacc50fe6157574d9cf1fe81",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c75a39d6ad76fdea31e74dd937bd4e41e2c0ca8ea4dfc995c4ce9e2e62e641df",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3d53d8d244ac5dadc9c8db42": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3d53d8d244ac5dadc9c8db42",
      "source_handle": "P0143",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探讨活体生物制剂CBM588对接受一线ICI联合治疗的mRCC患者肠道微生物组组成及菌群失调的影响。通过整合两项随机I期临床试验的数据，比较标准治疗（SOC）与SOC联合CBM588两组患者在基线和第12周的肠道微生物多样性、物种丰度变化以及Firmicutes/Bacteroidetes比率的变化。结果显示，CBM588显著纠正了菌群失调指标，并防止了与ICI反应相关的特定菌种耗竭，为CBM588改善临床结局提供了潜在的微生物机制解释。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::890fce072a8f724aaec9108f7e6fb477e88b3e6ebacc50fe6157574d9cf1fe81",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::844da22fc3eda3411fc1915ac1f709bb4007c2d4045e23b1a6b482337b383203",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9781aad6285eff9a9ca52532": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9781aad6285eff9a9ca52532",
      "source_handle": "P0143",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了CBM588这一特定益生菌制剂在mRCC ICI治疗背景下对肠道微生物组的具体调节作用。它展示了如何通过特定的微生物标志物（如E. siraeum的保护和F/B比率的降低）来量化“菌群失调”的纠正，并为理解益生菌辅助ICI治疗的机制提供了实证数据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::890fce072a8f724aaec9108f7e6fb477e88b3e6ebacc50fe6157574d9cf1fe81",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::84c610e236c027fc94660e903f644d5a1a84b8a67d8a85bd47bd2681966710a5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::56c7a21a7e043192307dcd02": {
      "atom_id": "atom::56c7a21a7e043192307dcd02",
      "source_handle": "P0143",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限mRCC人群；仅涉及CBM588一种制剂；样本量较小（N=58）；主要关注微生物组变化而非直接的临床疗效关联。",
        "contribution": "提供了益生菌（CBM588）调节肠道微生物组以可能增强ICI疗效的具体案例。数据显示CBM588能阻止有益菌（E. siraeum）的耗竭，并改善菌群失调指标（F/B比率）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::890fce072a8f724aaec9108f7e6fb477e88b3e6ebacc50fe6157574d9cf1fe81",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c9f13e755d07f6f4531d1fdf52aac336e49b0063131c542af6b04dd856dd0c6a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f955e507dc23c6b9c9aa9ee9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f955e507dc23c6b9c9aa9ee9",
      "source_handle": "P0143",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中关于“哪些微生物干预措施已被证明能调节微生物组并可能影响ICI疗效”的部分。可作为支持“特定益生菌可逆转ICI诱导的微生物组负面变化”的证据。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::890fce072a8f724aaec9108f7e6fb477e88b3e6ebacc50fe6157574d9cf1fe81",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::004ef9190562d6e1f6adb5c2eacd521bfe76164c4b890b357786666805ebde2f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e112410630a7f26d1436ed76": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e112410630a7f26d1436ed76",
      "source_handle": "P0143",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制仅为作者提出的“合理推测”（plausible mechanism），需结合其他文献验证E. siraeum在ICI反应中的具体生物学功能。F/B比率作为单一指标的局限性需注意。",
        "contribution": "提出了一个潜在的机制路径：通过维持Eubacterium siraeum等关键菌种的丰度和纠正F/B比率失衡，CBM588可能介导了对ICI治疗的更好反应。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::890fce072a8f724aaec9108f7e6fb477e88b3e6ebacc50fe6157574d9cf1fe81",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c9f13e755d07f6f4531d1fdf52aac336e49b0063131c542af6b04dd856dd0c6a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::eb51c2a96e28c4085a802519": {
      "atom_id": "atom::eb51c2a96e28c4085a802519",
      "source_handle": "P0143",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于讨论“微生物组-免疫系统相互作用”的具体机制假设。特别是关于短链脂肪酸产生菌（如Clostridium属）或特定有益菌在维持免疫微环境中的作用。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::890fce072a8f724aaec9108f7e6fb477e88b3e6ebacc50fe6157574d9cf1fe81",
