    "atom::1fddd054cd361aa8965f6785": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1fddd054cd361aa8965f6785",
      "source_handle": "P0125",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "既往研究表明 MRx0518 具有免疫刺激作用，但在对免疫检查点抑制剂产生耐药性的实体瘤患者中，将其与 pembrolizumab 联合使用的安全性和潜在临床益处尚不明确。本研究试图解决如何逆转或克服 ICIs 耐药的问题。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f63dfcb79a3ed06be7080d88b99e3f72f53931346bcc56ffcc4727bbc5001373",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e3f9d268e5d3581b800513ec2da4b364f805cc823d1262fb57ec6464a31ae7ff",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::dc4609987a117e2afc41874f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::dc4609987a117e2afc41874f",
      "source_handle": "P0125",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "针对对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）耐药的实体瘤患者，评估新型口服活体生物制剂 MRx0518（一种源自人肠道微生物群的 Enterococcus 属细菌）与 pembrolizumab 联合治疗的临床安全性及初步疗效。研究队列包括转移性肾细胞癌（mRCC）、非小细胞肺癌（mNSCLC）和膀胱癌患者。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f63dfcb79a3ed06be7080d88b99e3f72f53931346bcc56ffcc4727bbc5001373",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::92e426b4d3f7bb5cdb988a279dbcf8b7222551761d6db4c805566994957cb40f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::74fdb746ae398fcc75225601": {
      "atom_id": "atom::74fdb746ae398fcc75225601",
      "source_handle": "P0125",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文报告了一项 I/II 期临床试验的进展摘要。研究分为两部分：Part A 已完成，评估了 12 名 mRCC 和 mNSCLC 患者的联合治疗安全性；Part B 正在招募中，计划在每个适应症中额外招募最多 30 名患者。MRx0518 被选为开发候选药物是因为其体外和体内研究显示具有强效免疫刺激活性，能抑制肿瘤生长并调节 T 细胞分化。本研究旨在验证在 ICIs 耐药背景下，该联合疗法是否安全并能提供临床获益。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f63dfcb79a3ed06be7080d88b99e3f72f53931346bcc56ffcc4727bbc5001373",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a94ebda1184111926091f8bec3102bfcc0dedc5ef259161a1535a741b056c4e9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::39775608e9294273ec9d7df5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::39775608e9294273ec9d7df5",
      "source_handle": "P0125",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该文献作为一项正在进行中的临床试验记录，提供了将特定肠道菌群菌株（MRx0518）用于逆转免疫检查点抑制剂耐药性的具体临床方案设计和患者筛选标准。虽然缺乏最终疗效数据，但其对“ICIs 耐药”的操作性定义以及联合用药策略，对于综述中讨论微生态干预的临床转化路径和耐药机制背景具有重要参考价值。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f63dfcb79a3ed06be7080d88b99e3f72f53931346bcc56ffcc4727bbc5001373",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::886f82489a1e1ecd545bbb5e99a9d2d0ea055df31ee3487564fd4fb3f83ec88d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2806d2e7ae81fa8671642ad8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2806d2e7ae81fa8671642ad8",
      "source_handle": "P0125",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "由于缺乏疗效结果，不能证明 MRx0518 确实改善了耐药患者的预后。仅能说明这是一种正在进行的探索性策略。",
        "contribution": "提供了针对 ICIs 耐药实体瘤患者的具体临床干预方案（MRx0518 + pembrolizumab）。定义了“耐药”的临床操作标准（初始响应后进展，影像学确认，时间窗口限制）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f63dfcb79a3ed06be7080d88b99e3f72f53931346bcc56ffcc4727bbc5001373",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e5128c78e3ef3e2523d127c435c8239975905a845b36041a0201781836e5e849",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::081391015ee888a55dbb06c9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::081391015ee888a55dbb06c9",
      "source_handle": "P0125",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于综述中阐述微生态疗法在克服 ICIs 耐药方面的临床尝试现状。帮助界定哪些患者群体被视为潜在的微生态干预受益者。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f63dfcb79a3ed06be7080d88b99e3f72f53931346bcc56ffcc4727bbc5001373",
