      "source_handle": "P0125",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的免疫调节机制（Treg/Th1/Tc1 变化等）是基于前体研究（in vitro/in vivo models）的描述，并非本临床试验的实际结果。",
      "role": "evidence",
