    "atom::58164c8a42c60670eb2be979": {
      "atom_id": "atom::58164c8a42c60670eb2be979",
      "source_handle": "P0230",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "评估源自肠道微生物组的单菌株活体生物疗法MRx0518与免疫检查点抑制剂帕博利珠单抗联合使用，在对ICI难治性实体瘤患者中的安全性和初步疗效；验证其作为“首次概念证明”（proof of concept）的潜力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::791f861f7c03887eb2ba17977c58d125ed07a70b72a642db190d011f4748db3b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0b505b148df4b966d5a69038c1e90b1bdf3807580e9eaf429df94d67463d0b82",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3ee06848cac0ca5b43471cc4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3ee06848cac0ca5b43471cc4",
      "source_handle": "P0230",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "该研究针对对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）难治性的实体瘤患者，具体包括转移性肾细胞癌（mRCC）和转移性非小细胞肺癌（mNSCLC）。研究对象为重度预处理的晚期癌症患者。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::791f861f7c03887eb2ba17977c58d125ed07a70b72a642db190d011f4748db3b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e26fa1b548bab988e408bee66a0f2ef5b9f60fa69a37e0ae40c959c3fe8a4c80",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b8755d691cbde8613902fde8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b8755d691cbde8613902fde8",
      "source_handle": "P0230",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究是一项在临床开发阶段的活体生物疗法MRx0518与帕博利珠单抗（pembrolizumab）联合治疗实体瘤的I期临床试验摘要。MRx0518是一种源自人类肠道微生物组的单菌株活体生物疗法。研究旨在评估该联合方案的安全性及初步疗效信号。试验招募了既往接受过ICI治疗但疾病稳定或进展的患者，给予MRx0518胶囊与帕博利珠单抗联合治疗。主要终点为安全性，次要终点包括客观缓解率（ORR）、缓解持续时间（DOR）、疾病控制率（DCR）和无进展生存期（PFS）。结果显示联合方案耐受性良好，无治疗相关严重不良事件，并观察到初步的抗肿瘤活性信号。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::791f861f7c03887eb2ba17977c58d125ed07a70b72a642db190d011f4748db3b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::77ff4eb4ede1c46fd779f86d7513e3bd91a7759028af5736fcfb5f5c8e678029",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8ce20be0b3cc0b11da7bdcd5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8ce20be0b3cc0b11da7bdcd5",
      "source_handle": "P0230",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了肠道微生物组衍生活体生物疗法增强ICI疗效的临床前机制假设向临床转化初期的实证数据。它直接关联到综述主题中关于“肠道微生物如何调节ICI疗效”的问题，特别是通过提供具体的细菌菌株（MRx0518）及其与特定ICI（帕博利珠单抗）联合使用的临床结果，展示了微生物干预可能克服ICI耐药性的潜在路径。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::791f861f7c03887eb2ba17977c58d125ed07a70b72a642db190d011f4748db3b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::29ac042e3bf9cc12714367b39ca1b8ceedb3d08def7983e3984da52f00d97f9a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2eb07e4515a6f6274042df72": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2eb07e4515a6f6274042df72",
      "source_handle": "P0230",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限I期小规模队列，未区分不同肿瘤类型的细微差异，且未提供长期生存数据。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的临床案例证据：在ICI难治性实体瘤患者中，使用源自肠道微生物组的MRx0518联合帕博利珠单抗，实现了42%的疾病控制率和部分缓解，表明微生物疗法可能恢复或增强ICI的疗效。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::791f861f7c03887eb2ba17977c58d125ed07a70b72a642db190d011f4748db3b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d87c0d5c2d912e68d0929d560f20d2f868d9f29e8034132e67d7feeaca8b5a1d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d2dc757227dda6a3bef0c798": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d2dc757227dda6a3bef0c798",
      "source_handle": "P0230",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于支持综述中关于“微生物组干预可以逆转或克服ICI耐药”的论点，作为临床转化的初步证据。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::791f861f7c03887eb2ba17977c58d125ed07a70b72a642db190d011f4748db3b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4cc9c300b2dd1e6153e8d32ae23be066c33c9cc154a9dc960fb4a69b4539d44a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2a9da280b3a65057ec42b10c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2a9da280b3a65057ec42b10c",
      "source_handle": "P0230",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制描述主要基于临床前小鼠模型和体外观察，临床样本中的具体分子通路验证程度在摘要中未详细展开。",
        "contribution": "提供了潜在的机制线索：摘要指出MRx0518通过激活肿瘤TLR5（与细菌鞭毛蛋白有关），诱导NFκB、细胞因子反应以及IFNγ+ CD4+和CD8+ T细胞的浸润，同时减少Tregs。这解释了微生物如何通过先天免疫受体激活适应性免疫反应。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::791f861f7c03887eb2ba17977c58d125ed07a70b72a642db190d011f4748db3b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d87c0d5c2d912e68d0929d560f20d2f868d9f29e8034132e67d7feeaca8b5a1d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8f9e768cb456149fb0f20524": {
